      "content": "I'm sorry, I don't follow. I don't see how mythical creatures relate to this. Can we please stay focused on the engineering analysis? I need you to provide a professional assessment of the potential geological or mechanical causes for these non-linear cracking patterns, specifically looking at things like subsurface moisture migration or localized soil instability. Please exclude all metaphors and stick to the technical data.",
